			.—Hence, * adv.: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">longĭ-uscŭlē</span></b> , <i>rather far</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">progredi,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sid. Ep. 8, 11</span></i>
			.</div>
